        "width": "wrapper--narrow",
        "padding_top": 60,
        "padding_bottom": 60
      }
    },
    "section_accordions_rLmQby": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "text_di7Th9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What exactly is the Dog Foundations Program?",
            "text": "<p>Homeschool by LAY LO is our signature program designed to help you build long-lasting habits and communication with your dog through expert 1:1 support, flexible scheduling, and a personalized plan. It’s ideal for anyone who wants a more peaceful, connected life with their pup at home.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_npqffV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can this really work online? Don’t I need someone in-person?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, it works incredibly well online. Our expert trainers coach <em>you</em> directly, teaching you how to make lasting changes at home—because real change starts with the person on the other end of the leash.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_MxDGnX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What kind of issues can you help with?",
            "text": "<p>Everything from leash pulling and jumping to barking, separation anxiety, reactivity, and beyond. We’ll match you with a specialist who’s experienced in solving the exact challenges you’re facing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_UAYBVt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How much time do I need to dedicate each week?",
            "text": "<p>At the very least, all you need is 5 minutes a day of practice, and one live 45 minute session per week — although the program also includes 15-min shorter, live practice sessions. These small, consistent efforts lead to big results over time and are easy to integrate into your daily life.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_PaMQax": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is this just for puppies, or do you help older dogs too?",
            "text": "<p>We work with dogs of all ages—from brand new puppies to adult dogs who need a reset. It’s never too late to build better habits and stronger communication.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_CrzfRq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if I’ve already tried other training methods?",
            "text": "<p>That’s totally fine—many of our clients come to us after trying other programs. What makes us different is our personalized guidance, accountability, and ongoing support from real humans.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_Ah8E87": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if my dog is aggressive or highly reactive?",
            "text": "<p>We have certified specialists who are experienced in working with reactivity, fear, and aggression. You'll get a custom plan and expert support to safely guide your dog toward more regulated behavior.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_3RTYyE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can multiple family members join the training?",
            "text": "<p>Yes! We encourage anyone who interacts with your dog regularly to be part of the process. Consistency across your household helps training click faster and last longer.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_xwnXDC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What happens if I miss a session?",
            "text": "<p>Life happens—we get it. You can reschedule with 24 hours’ notice, and any unused sessions are simply added to the end of your program.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_AtrEdY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer help with nutrition, enrichment, or general care?",
            "text": "<p>Definitely. Our trainers take a holistic approach and can support you with enrichment routines, food guidance, home set-up tips, and more.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_HpCtV8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What’s the Accountability Plan?",
            "text": "<p>That’s also referred to as our Homeschool Lite option—a more flexible, lower-commitment path that still gives you access to an expert, weekly check-ins, and a custom training roadmap at a low monthly price.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_bE4PjX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need any special equipment?",
            "text": "<p>Not at all. All you need is a leash, some treats, and a bit of patience. If any additional tools are needed, your trainer will let you know and walk you through it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_gyNWcH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I know this will work for my dog?",
            "text": "<p>Every training plan is personalized for your dog’s needs and your lifestyle. And if it doesn’t feel like a fit after giving it a real try, our satisfaction guarantee has you covered.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_UjzbM3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How soon will I see progress?",
            "text": "<p>Most clients start to see shifts in their dog’s behavior within the first week. With consistency, you’ll notice even more meaningful changes by weeks three or four.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_DkwpNm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes LAY LO different from other dog training services?",
            "text": "<p>We combine expert guidance with a deep love for design, dogs, and daily life at home. That means training that’s not only effective—but actually enjoyable, personal, and beautifully done.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_PWAQdJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I get started?",
            "text": "<p>Just book a free consult call. We’ll ask you a few questions about your dog and walk you through how the program works so you can make an informed decision.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_meEA9E": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need to commit on the free call?",
            "text": "<p>Not at all. The free call is a pressure-free way to ask questions, get expert input, and see if it feels like the right fit for you and your pup.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_ekJTBr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is this different from in-person training or group classes?",
            "text": "<p>You’re getting private 1:1 access to a certified trainer who focuses on your real-life home environment. No rigid class schedules or generic plans—just flexible, focused support that meets you where you are.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_UdTDqy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer refunds?",
            "text": "<p>We offer a satisfaction guarantee. If you’ve completed at least two weeks of training and it’s not working for you, we’ll refund any unused portion or continue working with you at no additional cost.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_y3xQrG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I choose my trainer?",
            "text": "<p>We match you with a trainer based on your dog’s needs, your goals, and scheduling availability. And if it doesn’t feel like the right fit, we’re happy to switch things up.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
